#
# ⚠⚠ QUADRATIC RESPEC, 10 Sep 2026 - c and c' are no longer single linear
# slopes. PJ asked whether the 2015 break/sign-flip found in
# 49_mediation_breakpoint_test.R was really just non-linearity in the
# Prof->Turbulence relationship - checked directly (41o_mediation_quadratic.R):
