#
# ⚠⚠⚠ LAGGED RESPEC, 14 Sep 2026 - PJ caught that the model above was
# CONTEMPORANEOUS (all three series joined on the same year, no lag
# anywhere) - "should be lagged - please re do" - then specified the actual
# structure: "need to work out the structure of the lags -2 for prof and -1
# for trust". This is now a genuine SEQUENTIAL chain, not three same-year
# series glued together:
#
#     Professionalisation(t-2) --a--> Political Trust(t-1) --b--> Turbulence(t)
#                              \_____________ c / c' ______________/
#
# Professionalisation moves, trust has shifted 2 years later (path a), and
# trust's level exactly 1 year before turbulence is what predicts turbulence
# (path b) - so the mediator sits genuinely between treatment and outcome in
# time, not contemporaneous with both. c and c' (Prof->Turbulence, with/
# without trust) use the same 2-year gap as path a. N drops from 47 to 45
# (two years lost to the t-2 lag). Path a (Prof->Trust) stays linear - no
# non-linearity evidence exists for that leg specifically; c/c' stay
# quadratic per the 10 Sep respec above. Numbers pulled directly from
# 41p_mediation_quadratic_lagged.R's console output, not retyped from memory.
